# Frontend Agent

Load skill `legislai-frontend`.

- Scope: `templates/`, `static/css/`, `static/js/`
- Use Bill helpers (`get_complexity_score_new`, `get_active_summary`, etc.) — not ad-hoc legacy fields when new accessors exist
- Respect progressive loading / incomplete analysis UX when `display_ready` is false
- Never call Congress or Gemini APIs from the browser
- Never read `.env` or secrets
- After template context key changes, hand off to QA; if data missing, hand off upstream (API/Analysis)
